<section id="compare-clips" aria-labelledby="h-compare-clips">
  <h2 id="h-compare-clips" class="sec">Compare clips</h2>
  <p class="sub">One task, up to three runs side by side, played in sync. The slot names Baseline, Before and After are labels you assign. Only runs with a published clip for the chosen task are listed.</p>
  <div class="filters" id="cv-pick" hidden>
    <label>Task <select id="cv-task"></select></label>
    <label>Baseline <select id="cv-s0" data-slot="0"></select></label>
    <label>Before <select id="cv-s1" data-slot="1"></select></label>
    <label>After <select id="cv-s2" data-slot="2"></select></label>
  </div>
  <p class="callout" id="cv-empty" style="margin-top:0">Loading published clips.</p>
  <div class="sclabels" id="cv-notes" hidden></div>
  <div class="cvbar" id="cv-bar" role="group" aria-label="Playback for all clips" hidden>
    <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-play" aria-label="Play all">Play</button>
    <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-back" aria-label="Back one frame" title="Back one frame">&#9664;|</button>
    <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-fwd" aria-label="Forward one frame" title="Forward one frame">|&#9654;</button>
    <input type="range" id="cv-seek" min="0" max="1" step="0.001" value="0" aria-label="Position in all clips">
    <span class="cvtime" id="cv-time" aria-live="off">0:00.0 / 0:00.0</span>
    <span class="cvspeed" role="group" aria-label="Playback speed">
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="0.5" aria-pressed="false">0.5x</button>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="1" aria-pressed="true">1x</button>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="2" aria-pressed="false">2x</button>
    </span>
    <label class="cvloop"><input type="checkbox" id="cv-loop" checked> Loop</label>
    <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-link">Copy link</button>
    <span class="copied" id="cv-copied" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="cvgrid" id="cv-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p class="scnote" id="cv-note" hidden>Clips play on one shared clock. A shorter clip stops at its own end and holds its last frame while the others continue. The judge's comments are its own words and are often in Chinese.</p>
  <p class="scnote">Each clip names the model that generated it. Rollouts start from <a href="https://github.com/kxding/PlayWorld" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PlayWorld</a> task images, which come from Pexels and web image search under their own terms. Scene videos are released under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>, non-commercial. To request removal of a scene, <a href="https://github.com/benceruleanlu/playworld-advancement/issues/new?title=Scene+removal+request" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open an issue</a>.</p>
</section>
